# CLARION CALL: one tank for the whole run. Thrust burns a unit of fuel
# a frame; with the tank dry the burner takes coins instead, one for every
# six frames of thrust; with no coins either the ship can't thrust at all,
# drops, and bursts when it reaches the ground: the run is over (there are
# no lives), and A goes back to the title.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 10
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat place 100 180
cheat vel 0 0
cheat fuel 0
cheat coins 10
hold A 30
expect fuel == 0
expect coins == 5
expect vy < 0
# no coins: nothing to burn
cheat coins 0
hold A 30
expect vy > 0
expect dead == 0
waituntil dead == 1 200
expect state == 7
wait 110
expect state == 8
wait 100
press A
wait 5
expect state == 0
# the tank never holds more than its size
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat fuel 790
cheat give 19
expect fuel == 800
# the spare tank: 200 more room, and 200 in it now
cheat fuel 500
cheat give 17
expect fuelmax == 1000
expect fuel == 700
